--- PATCH: package.json additions ---
---
--- Add Groq SDK and Google Cloud TTS to the NanoClaw host process dependencies.
---
--- Apply: Run these commands in the NanoClaw fork root:
---

npm install groq-sdk @google-cloud/text-to-speech

--- This adds:
---   "groq-sdk": "^0.9.0"
---   "@google-cloud/text-to-speech": "^5.5.0"
---
--- to the host process package.json (not the container's).
---
--- The voice transcription and TTS happen on the HOST process,
--- not inside the agent container. This keeps the container lightweight
--- and avoids passing audio through Docker stdin/stdout.
